default reject toolz.__getattr__: the module __getattr__ of toolz runs only when an attribute lookup on the module toolz fails; no receiver here is that module with a missing attribute
default reject toolz.functoolz.Compose.__eq__: no Compose reaches this comparison or key lookup (B3: a package object where any value is accepted is not considered; the roles that admit a Compose are judgement J1)
default reject toolz.functoolz.Compose.__hash__: no Compose is hashed here (B3; the roles that admit a Compose are judgement J1)
default reject toolz.functoolz.curry.__eq__: no curry reaches this comparison or key lookup (B3; the roles that admit a curry are judgement J1)
default reject toolz.functoolz.curry.__hash__: no curry is hashed here (B3; the roles that admit a curry are judgement J1)
default reject toolz.sandbox.core.EqualityHashKey.__eq__: no EqualityHashKey reaches this comparison or key lookup (B3; EqualityHashKey keys reach only unique's key role and the methods of the class)
default reject toolz.sandbox.core.EqualityHashKey.__hash__: no EqualityHashKey is hashed here (B3; EqualityHashKey keys reach only unique's key role)

